ISO-10303-21;
/* Tb016: 5 EDGE_CURVEs, 6 VERTEX_POINTs; each adjacent vertex pair offset 2.0E-7 mm in +y; per-edge gap sub-tolerance (1.0E-6); cumulative drift after 5 edges = 1.0E-6 = tol; end-to-end closure depends on summing vs per-pair check; OCC yields empty */
